      "problem": "$5$ is **not** an irrational number, and $\\pi $ is **not** a rational number.\n\nExpress the compound statement above in symbolic form given the following:\n\n- $P:5\\text{ is an irrational number}$\n\n- $Q:\\pi \\text{ is a rational number}$",
